 "", "delay": 0, "is_hurt": 0}, "590112": {"id": 590112, "motion_name": "motions/login.mtn", "touch_area": "0", "probability": 1.0, "voice": "GUN|RPK203_0|HELLO", "delay": 0, "is_hurt": 0}}, "voiceData": {"590101": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "590102": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "590103": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "590104": {"char_code": "RPK203_0", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE1", "caption": "I know I'm still small and I'm not strong enough yet, but I want to do my best to complete the tasks given to me and not leave behind too many regrets."}, "590105": {"char_code": "RPK203_0", "voice_key": "FORMATION", "caption": "I'm here! Is everyone present? You mustn't be late!"}, "590106": {"char_code": "RPK203_0", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE3", "caption": "Hm... The work summary for today is done. There are so many of them stored up. Take a look at this, Commander, as well as these and these and these, they're all going to be precious records in the future!"}, "590107": {"char_code": "RPK203_0", "voice_key": "SKILL2", "caption": "Let's get them, teddy!"}, "590108": {"char_code": "RPK203_0", "voice_key": "BLACKACTION", "caption": "I will bring you the best outcome."}, "590109": {"char_code": "RPK203_0", "voice_key": "DIALOGUEWEDDING", "caption": "Being surrounded by teddy bears of all shapes and sizes and being by your side is like a fairytale, Commander. ...No, how could I let myself get distracted? Pull yourself together, RPK-203, we still have work to do!"}, "590110": {"char_code": "RPK203_0", "voice_key": "SOULCONTRACT", "caption": "Commander, Teddy and I like you very much. <> Do you want to be with us for always? <> Then hold my hand tight and don't get lost."}, "590111": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "590112": {"char_code": "RPK203_0", "voice_key": "HELLO", "caption": "Commander... Um, judging by the look on your face, I take it you've finished digesting the combat reports I submitted earlier?"}}}